{"type":"block","data":{"id":"adoctext2000000000000000000","parentId":"adoccard2000000000000000000","rootId":"bdoc00000000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"text","title":"## What is needed\nA page about installing and running the project from scratch: what is needed beforehand, which commands to run, how to tell everything came up.\n\nCheck the steps on a clean machine or in a container rather than copying them out of the README.\n\n## How to tell it is done\nSomebody seeing the project for the first time gets from the page to a running app without guessing once.","fields":{},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
