{"type":"block","data":{"id":"adoctext3000000000000000000","parentId":"adoccard3000000000000000000","rootId":"bdoc00000000000000000000000","createdBy":"system","modifiedBy":"system","schema":1,"type":"text","title":"## What is needed\nThe settings in the code have drifted away from the page about them: some were renamed, some are gone, and the new ones are not on the page.\n\nCheck the page against what the code reads and fix it: the name, the default, what happens when it is not set.\n\n## Important\nInvent nothing: where the code does not make it clear what a setting does, mark that and ask.","fields":{},"createAt":1785888000000,"updateAt":1785888000000,"deleteAt":0}}
